1
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,754
Oh, Mr. Park!

2
00:00:04,754 --> 00:00:06,339
Hey!

3
00:00:06,673 --> 00:00:08,216
Sorry I'm late.

4
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:10,510
Yesterday's drinks
got to me...

5
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:11,510
No worries at all.

6
00:00:12,262 --> 00:00:14,639
By the way, did you see her?

7
00:00:14,639 --> 00:00:15,432
See who?

8
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:17,267
The woman who just walked out.

9
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,060
Do you know her?

10
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,896
Of course I do!
She's gorgeous, right?

11
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:27,485
Yeah... she is.

12
00:00:29,988 --> 00:00:32,824
Hands off though. She's taken.

13
00:00:32,824 --> 00:00:36,703
Right... got it.

14
00:00:36,703 --> 00:00:38,955
I've had

15
00:00:39,539 --> 00:00:42,542
a thing for her forever.

16
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:45,962
What?

17
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:48,339
Why are you so surprised?

18
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:51,676
She's Ji-sung's older sister!

19
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:52,719
His sister?

20
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:55,305
Yeah! That woman who just
came to drop something.

21
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:57,640
She's Ji-sung's sister.

22
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,435
Oh, so...

23
00:01:00,435 --> 00:01:01,770
Exactly!

24
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:05,982
Been crushing on her for years
so don't even think about it.

25
00:01:06,524 --> 00:01:10,361
She's the kind of woman
who packs your lunch

26
00:01:11,446 --> 00:01:13,698
and wipes rice

27
00:01:13,698 --> 00:01:16,659
off your lips, you know?

28
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:23,500
Looks like you've made
a lot of progress.

29
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:25,085
Progress?

30
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:27,796
You were so lost
the other day.

31
00:01:27,796 --> 00:01:29,380
Now you've made up your mind?

32
00:01:29,672 --> 00:01:31,257
Well...

33
00:01:32,050 --> 00:01:33,885
it's not about
deciding anything.

34
00:01:33,885 --> 00:01:35,845
It's just...

35
00:01:35,845 --> 00:01:38,223
I feel more
at ease now, I guess.

36
00:01:38,223 --> 00:01:40,058
I see.

37
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:40,975
Got it.

38
00:01:40,975 --> 00:01:43,937
Feels like we're finally
going to see each other soon.

39
00:01:43,937 --> 00:01:45,647
All of a sudden?

40
00:01:45,647 --> 00:01:48,525
But why? I thought you said
we were just pen pals.

41
00:01:48,525 --> 00:01:49,901
Yeah... I did.

42
00:01:49,901 --> 00:01:51,861
But... I kind of
want to see you now.

43
00:01:52,612 --> 00:01:54,739
Wow. That'd be amazing.

44
00:01:54,739 --> 00:01:56,741
You'd better be ready
to play a real match with me.

45
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,993
Yes.
